<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We hope you're still interested in pursuing one of the highly ranked and prestigious graduate degrees offered by the <a href="https://chs.asu.edu/programs/graduate">College of Health Solutions</a> at Arizona State University.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We're here to help you throughout the <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/dgsadmissions/Index.jsp">application</a> process and can provide tips and advice on how to be a more competitive applicant. Please reach out if you would like to schedule a phone call or personal advising session.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">I look forward to hearing from you soon as you take the next step in your career and your life.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Regards,&nbsp;</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">{!User.Email}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div><font color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>